{"id":768,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><div><p>9月9日，体育学院本科生党支部在院楼209会议室组织开展了一场以学习 7 月 19 日中共中央新闻发布会为主题的学习会议。本次会议全体党员参加，李佳怿老师出席并担任主持人。&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p>会上，李佳怿老师带领全体党员回顾了 7 月 19 日中共中央新闻发布会的重要内容。这场新闻发布会聚焦重大主题，传递出了党在新时代的新思想、新战略、新举措。李佳怿老师强调，全体党员要以此次学习为契机，不断提高政治站位，增强党性修养，深刻领会党中央的决策部署。同时，要将学习成果转化为实际行动，积极投身到实践中去，以实际行动践行党的宗旨。&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>此次党课活动，通过深入学习中共中央新闻发布会精神，进一步激发了党员们的奋斗热情，为推动学院各项工作的高质量发展注入了强大动力。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=wo77X4UNU4M7CsU/lLZnlUbMm74Lz-KYM49Pn7lsnmNZU8L0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yZokh7UShRLNVknl7YnRGaMlV2nmLDMzrfnzf2MNQVoRAFL7V2UmNDoRfFMmrRLm9Jv2bjo4Oeosnb_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUDg474LzlagtA8pUOcc&oid=1054562613&tid=1046&nid=13150&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/F88DAC2ABEA2D005AFF3655AE0F6FE88/0AFB9680/65C28\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=wo77X4UNU4M7CsU/lLZnlUbMm74Lz-KYM49Pn7lsnmNZU8L0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yZokh7UShRLNVknl7YnRGaMlV2nmLDMzrfnzf2MNQVoRAFL7V2UmNDoRfFMmrRLm9Jv2bjo4Oeosnb_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUDg474LzlagtA8pUOcc&oid=1054562613&tid=1046&nid=13150&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=wUzQX7M7CZM47YL/mGbUm-8nmvYUzUKaMzLDU4f7n7CYoRL0gihFp2hmCIa0nSyZnSy4MShRLmL8U8V2Uz9bozUsMz-PoRliU4A2U4CYLmnFn7CPL7LbLmTFMmLDU8UJv2bjo4Oeosnb_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUDg474LzlagtA8pUOcc&oid=1054562613&tid=1046&nid=13150&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/E8E35C234CAFA89947521855C8FC6224/DF10C929/636CD\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=wUzQX7M7CZM47YL/mGbUm-8nmvYUzUKaMzLDU4f7n7CYoRL0gihFp2hmCIa0nSyZnSy4MShRLmL8U8V2Uz9bozUsMz-PoRliU4A2U4CYLmnFn7CPL7LbLmTFMmLDU8UJv2bjo4Oeosnb_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUDg474LzlagtA8pUOcc&oid=1054562613&tid=1046&nid=13150&e=.png\"></p><p><br /></p></div></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://tyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=wo77X4UNU4M7CsU/lLZnlUbMm74Lz-KYM49Pn7lsnmNZU8L0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yZokh7UShRLNVknl7YnRGaMlV2nm